{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/bb4080cebac08db418c6ab19190e2176.avif?t=1765792328\" width=400 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Curse We Made</strong> is <i>a short ride into a cursed town.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Gravebrook by train, stepping into a place abandoned by time and swallowed by shadows. Each street, shop, and room hides handcrafted puzzles, waiting to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll face eerie ghouls, whispering monsters, and unsettling remnants of the town\u2019s past. With every puzzle completed, color returns to the world, and the story of the curse slowly unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.poster.avif?t=1765792328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.webm?t=1765792328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.mp4?t=1765792328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn art, atmospheric soundscapes, and a cozy-gothic tone, The Curse We Made offers a short, relaxing puzzle-adventure, designed to be experienced at your own pace, for fans of cozy, dark, story-driven games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features &amp; Gameplay Highlights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa 32 handcrafted, gentle puzzles set across eerie, hand-drawn locations \u2014 from haunted restaurants to candlelit churches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Explore the town of Gravebrook, uncovering secrets in each shop, motel room, and crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Meet the townsfolk \u2014 haunted, regretful, or ghostly \u2014 and piece together their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Read diaries, journals, and whispers to slowly understand what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Follow Pesto the cat, your sarcastic and surprisingly helpful guide through the gloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa No timers, no pressure \u2014 puzzles are designed to feel intuitive and calming, letting you focus on the story and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Solve to heal \u2014 every mystery solved brings warmth, light, and color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Immerse yourself in cozy-gothic ambience with original soundscapes and atmospheric art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Pinch of Revenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/086f19a3ba908ccde69a272597e6acc190c6f8dc.jpg"},{"name":"Dinner Served Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/339c8a0177d732807fa850b1c581e58103b98cd6.jpg"},{"name":"Past Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/91cff7ad3cafa80b8784559988b1ddba0c68117d.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Approved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/a625c87cf0371186383d49f7695f83857ba82f41.jpg"},{"name":"Potion Notion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/1f477634a5e2daef941217d8ed8f7c7cde07a610.jpg"},{"name":"Checked In Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/f95fc1a9cb518850458078050fb8b3cd256222a1.jpg"},{"name":"Room for Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/5dd4d8eef83b477f9f8c80730cde21d3bff767b0.jpg"},{"name":"Candlelight Confession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/0d080da7242b86f3365838123fda4c3d79824277.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031810/76b0879a448f70852dbfdf634aaeab5e1b645748.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031810?t=1765792328","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031810?t=1765792328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/893e1faf5dfa9d2fe6e7eb193a7509967dc0b875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765792328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/893e1faf5dfa9d2fe6e7eb193a7509967dc0b875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765792328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild horror themes, stylized depictions of blood, and narrative elements involving death and tragedy.\r\nThe hand-drawn art style is not realistic, but the atmosphere is dark and may be frightening for younger players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/bb4080cebac08db418c6ab19190e2176.avif?t=1765792328\" width=400 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Curse We Made</strong> is <i>a short ride into a cursed town.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in Gravebrook by train, stepping into a place abandoned by time and swallowed by shadows. Each street, shop, and room hides handcrafted puzzles, waiting to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll face eerie ghouls, whispering monsters, and unsettling remnants of the town\u2019s past. With every puzzle completed, color returns to the world, and the story of the curse slowly unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.poster.avif?t=1765792328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.webm?t=1765792328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/extras/3f86bedcdf8c137eeaafa8588d9a6f22.mp4?t=1765792328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn art, atmospheric soundscapes, and a cozy-gothic tone, The Curse We Made offers a short, relaxing puzzle-adventure, designed to be experienced at your own pace, for fans of cozy, dark, story-driven games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features &amp; Gameplay Highlights:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa 32 handcrafted, gentle puzzles set across eerie, hand-drawn locations \u2014 from haunted restaurants to candlelit churches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Explore the town of Gravebrook, uncovering secrets in each shop, motel room, and crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Meet the townsfolk \u2014 haunted, regretful, or ghostly \u2014 and piece together their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Read diaries, journals, and whispers to slowly understand what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Follow Pesto the cat, your sarcastic and surprisingly helpful guide through the gloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa No timers, no pressure \u2014 puzzles are designed to feel intuitive and calming, letting you focus on the story and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Solve to heal \u2014 every mystery solved brings warmth, light, and color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Immerse yourself in cozy-gothic ambience with original soundscapes and atmospheric art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Potion Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031810/1c7a48502a3e1f683996edccdf15fede71496d8a/header.jpg?t=1765792328","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Potion Pixel Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4031810/1092634179/c1bb25ee551aa908b292160c9edf4bc1c06ab487/1760196391/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764829548","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4031810/1092634179/c1bb25ee551aa908b292160c9edf4bc1c06ab487/1760196391/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764829548","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4031810/1092634179/c1bb25ee551aa908b292160c9edf4bc1c06ab487/1760196391/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764829548","id":257216117,"name":"Official Trailer - The Curse We Made","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216117/0e8df597f1b0406a8d1055128427543340206448/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764829548"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4031810/4809095